//@version=6
// OptionLap · Gamma + Delta heatmap + Opening Range + IB + daily Volume Profile  (v6.7, MenthorQ paste, clean breaks, 1-min volume profile, plan alert with contract calculator)
// Each level = a price box and, right under it, a value box ($M).
//   Negative value → brown, positive value → fluorescent. Stronger value → brighter band.
// One section per company (SPX + Mag 7). The section that matches the open chart is drawn automatically,
//   so switching TSLA → NVDA shows NVDA's levels, and going back to TSLA shows TSLA's again. Inputs save with the indicator.
// Numbers: MenthorQ, or python3 team/tools/gex.py _SPX next --pine. For education only, not a recommendation.
indicator("OptionLap · Gamma + Delta + OR (Mag 7)", shorttitle="OL Gamma", overlay=true, max_lines_count=300, max_labels_count=150, max_boxes_count=500)

// ───────── الشركة المعروضة ─────────
grpX = "يعرض لفلات الشركة المفتوحة بالشارت بس"
spxAlias = input.string("SPX,SPX500,US500,ES1!,MES1!", "رموز سباكس", group=grpX, tooltip="أي شارت من هالرموز يعرض لفلات SPX")

